<title>UK: Rabobank sets 500 million mark four-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 500 million mark four-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead manager Goldman Sachs International and Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND BA</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    14.FEB.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.525   PAY DATE    14.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.15	REOFFER    99.60     SPREAD	+6 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMS/FFT   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NETHS     HOME CTRY  NETHS     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OBL 117</p>
<p> NOTES	RATED AAA BY IBCA.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
